      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>An umasi can spend 10 minutes grafting the flesh of other living or recently dead humanoids onto their body, attempting a DC 20 Medicine  check with the effects of Treat Wounds. This process is the only way an umasi can recover Hit Points.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
